WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.763 --> 00:00:05.295
At last, it has begun...

00:00:06.444 --> 00:00:08.249
It has been centuries, and still... the chessboard remains

00:00:08.777 --> 00:00:12.506
The black king has not moved at all

00:00:13.251 --> 00:00:17.115
He remains seated on his throne

00:00:17.482 --> 00:00:21.412
Is it indifference or arrogance behind his inaction?

00:00:23.075 --> 00:00:24.902
In five hundred years

00:00:25.042 --> 00:00:27.163
I have never forgotten that gaze

00:00:27.889 --> 00:00:30.066
When she cast the Curse of Immortality

00:00:30.707 --> 00:00:37.399
I saw neither pity nor pleasure in the Ruler of Death's eyes

00:00:40.359 --> 00:00:42.473
A Traveler

00:00:42.473 --> 00:00:46.659
Arrives here in Snezhnaya after a highly eventful journey through the six other nations

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.881
Now, he requests an audience with our god. An offer of an open dialogue

00:00:53.894 --> 00:00:56.686
Or does he have ulterior motives?

00:00:56.686 --> 00:00:58.929
By collecting the Gnoses

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:02.012
You hope to gain power beyond the level of Cryo Archon?

00:01:02.284 --> 00:01:05.560
Once the remains of the Third Descender are no longer scattered across the world...

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:09.012
Only then, we may behold the legacy he sealed away

00:01:10.526 --> 00:01:12.842
If we gather enough of these Seals of Life

00:01:12.842 --> 00:01:15.537
We might truly be able to defy death after all

00:01:16.381 --> 00:01:18.052
When that lady gave this power to my ancestors

00:01:18.052 --> 00:01:21.453
Perhaps the contract she made

00:01:21.453 --> 00:01:23.797
Was for this purpose

00:01:31.379 --> 00:01:34.051
Locked on — no escape!

00:01:35.574 --> 00:01:37.471
More where that came from

00:01:40.886 --> 00:01:44.287
I don't just sing for me

00:01:44.526 --> 00:01:48.705
I sing for every Water Imp whose voice has ever graced this theater

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:52.022
I'm the only one left

00:01:52.174 --> 00:01:54.320
I'm the only one

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:55.924
Who can keep these songs alive

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:00.854
Taking the stage

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:09.477
An elegy to mortality

00:02:12.226 --> 00:02:16.804
Our love... was spoiled long ago by the Heavenly Principles

00:02:17.368 --> 00:02:18.625
Strange...

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.656
I sense Pavlina's aura on you

00:02:21.656 --> 00:02:24.405
Did she fail after all?

00:02:27.405 --> 00:02:30.626
If everyone agrees to remove the seal

00:02:30.847 --> 00:02:34.342
A truth laid buried for five hundred years will come to light

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.398
In all this time

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:41.821
I've had no great ambition to recover my stolen morsel

00:02:43.473 --> 00:02:46.767
But if it were used to extract life

00:02:46.776 --> 00:02:48.697
Or even defy death...

00:02:49.482 --> 00:02:51.905
It would be a grave transgression

00:02:53.353 --> 00:02:58.083
Now... I can kill without further consequence

00:02:58.083 --> 00:02:59.956
Snezhnaya

00:02:59.961 --> 00:03:05.692
Has lived under the threat of annihilation by a Nail of Retribution at any moment

00:03:05.692 --> 00:03:08.475
...Asmoday? You've met her?

00:03:08.475 --> 00:03:11.042
The Shades of the Heavenly Principles

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:14.387
Life, Death, Time, and Space

00:03:14.387 --> 00:03:17.784
Are ubiquitous

00:03:17.784 --> 00:03:18.916
Surely, you don't really think

00:03:18.916 --> 00:03:23.389
You have what it takes to face me head on?

00:03:23.393 --> 00:03:26.905
I didn't know gods liked to trash-talk their opponents

00:03:26.999 --> 00:03:32.183
Whatever the price may be, whatever I must suffer, so be it!

00:03:33.516 --> 00:03:35.433
Ronova!!!

00:03:44.979 --> 00:03:47.003
It is time to begin the next phase of the plan

00:03:50.993 --> 00:03:54.497
It seems I'll have to reclaim what is mine

00:03:56.185 --> 00:03:57.812
Care to stop me

00:03:58.213 --> 00:03:59.832
Cryo Archon?

